{"ref":"BDB, אֱלִיצָפָן","hw":"אֱלִיצָפָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיצָפָן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>God has protected</em>, cf. Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">צפנבעל</span><strong>) </strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  chief of the Kohathites <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:30\" href=\"/Numbers.3.30\">Nu 3:30</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.8\">1 Ch 15:8</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.13\">2 Ch 29:13</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְצָפָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:22\" href=\"/Exodus.6.22\">Ex 6:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.4\">Lv 10:4</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  chief of Zebulun <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:25\" href=\"/Numbers.34.25\">Nu 34:25</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱלִיקָא","prev":"BDB, אֱלִיצוּר"}